# AdvancedTabManager Release Notes

## v1.4.0 (19 Feb 2026)
A maintenance release focused on driver reliability (macOS Apple Silicon fixes), internationalization, modular refactors, and improved browser options.

### Added
- Full translation support for UI and log messages (English, Japanese, Korean, Chinese, Filipino). (commit 58180ad)
- Advanced browser options and an integrated Proxy Test UI (ProxyTestThread). (commit f836931)
- Firefox automation support via Selenium (service + driver handling). (commit 40356df)
- Driver verification and fallback utilities (`_verify_executable`, `_install_driver`). (commit 836c733)

### Fixed
- Detect and gracefully handle `Exec format error` for driver binaries (architecture mismatch on Apple Silicon); added fallbacks and clearer error reporting. (commit 836c733)
- Guard accesses to `Service.process` during start/stop/cleanup to avoid runtime warnings and crashes. (commit 836c733)
- Linux connection-stability improvements and more robust WebDriver retry handling. (commit 143ee9a)
- `resource_path` bug fix to resolve resources from the project root. (commit 4c48ac9)

### Changed / Refactored
- Refactor translations into external files and improve i18n handling. (commits 611548a, 58180ad)
- Modular refactor of the main app into components for better maintainability and testing. (commit 40356df)
- Improved driver/process cleanup and logging for more reliable shutdowns. (commit 836c733)

### Docs / Chores
- Documentation updates, new issue/PR templates, and README improvements. (commits 8f65a20, 2fddef7, c80bbd6, 04d9bee, 3afe261)
- Dependency and packaging updates (`requirements.txt`, `pyproject.toml`). (commit a6ef607)
- CI/workflow and repository metadata updates (build, funding, .gitignore). (commits 4aabdd1, 5aec6ee, 5c0661a)

